{12}{Quiet!  This insolence is unforgivable!  The violation of my ancient right for solitude in exile is not broken so easily!  Your life hangs in the balance stranger!  Speak quickly, lest you taste of the fury of Harrow...[He hefts a double-edged axe from his belt.]}{Quiet!  This insolence is unforgivable!  The violation of my ancient right for solitude in exile is not broken so easily!  Your life hangs in the balance stranger!  Speak quickly, lest you taste of the fury of Harrow...[He hefts a double-edged axe from his belt.]}{}{3}{}{}
