{25}{Yes,  I'm very sure you do!  You stole their honor, and then stripped me of mine!  I've thought much on your previous threats, elf!  Perhaps we should negotiate once again! [He raises the axe above his head.]}{Yes,  I'm very sure you do!  You stole their honor, and then stripped me of mine!  I've thought much on your previous threats, elf!  Perhaps we should negotiate once again! [He raises the axe above his head.]}{}{5}{}{}
