{30}{No!  I'm very sorry, but you've made a terrible, terrible mistake.  You're going nowhere...I've come here to writhe upon the blade of my sorrow, to live the thousand deaths by the ancient right of Kings.  These laws are passed down through the mountain, from the beginning of remembered time.  Your life is forfeit to them, as is my own.  Do you understand? [He raises the axe in his hand...]}{No!  I'm very sorry, but you've made a terrible, terrible mistake.  You're going nowhere...I've come here to writhe upon the blade of my sorrow, to live the thousand deaths by the ancient right of Kings.  These laws are passed down through the mountain, from the beginning of remembered time.  Your life is forfeit to them, as is my own.  Do you understand? [He raises the axe in his hand...]}{}{6}{}{}
