{61}{No, stranger!  You must listen to ME. [Looming closer.]  I've come here to writhe upon the blade of my sorrow, to live the thousand deaths, by the ancient right of Kings.  These laws are passed down through the mountain, from the beginning or remembered time.  Your life is forfeit to them, as is my own.  Do you understand? [He raises the axe in his hand...]}{No, stranger!  You must listen to ME. [Looming closer.]  I've come here to writhe upon the blade of my sorrow, to live the thousand deaths, by the ancient right of Kings.  These laws are passed down through the mountain, from the beginning or remembered time.  Your life is forfeit to them, as is my own.  Do you understand? [He raises the axe in his hand...]}{}{12}{}{}
