{375}{You don't know the half of it...they're not on the Isle of Despair...}{}{5}{}{377}{}
{376}{E:}{}{5}{}{0}{}
{377}{What?  What do you mean?  Were they killed?  Ahhhh!   It hurts...!}{What?  What do you mean?  Were they killed?  Ahhhh!   It hurts...!}{}{78}{}{}
{378}{No...they were never sent there...}{}{5}{}{380}{}
